  after: [
    "The first result is 2 then 1. moved removes 2 and reinserts it, so that result is 1 then 2. sets.empty<Int> () makes an empty integer Set: <Int> chooses its element type and () is Unit, the no-additional-input argument. Array values and their show output use square brackets, as in [2, 1].",
    "The last line converts the original values again and still returns 2 then 1. Neither the updates used to construct moved nor the conversion changes values. pub effect fn main is the entry; do sequences println calls, and show makes display text."
